      content: "Task id \"49f9382e-a5a8-4ac9-ad38-8127f285cebb/task-58\" finished with result:\nCommand output:\nhasDiag: true phase: menuLaunch btn text: Launch M-01 \342\200\224 First ContactAfter launch phase: playingPointer lock state: {\"nativePointerLockElementTag\":\"CANVAS\",\"lockOwned\":true,\"canvasExists\":true}PASS: Pointer Lock engaged on game canvas nativeLocked=true, activeLocked=truePASS: 1280x720 aim boundary width = 45% (576px, half 288px) {\"shape\":\"rounded-rect\",\"hudW\":576,\"hudH\":324,\"hudR\":40.5,\"hudVW\":1280,\"hudVH\":720,\"pathCount\":4,\"allHaveArcs\":true,\"engineW\":576,\"engineH\":324,\"engineHalfW\":288,\"engineHalfH\":162,\"engineR\":40.5}PASS: 1280x720 aim boundary height = 45% (324px, half 162px) {\"shape\":\"rounded-rect\",\"hudW\":576,\"hudH\":324,\"hudR\":40.5,\"hudVW\":1280,\"hudVH\":720,\"pathCount\":4,\"allHaveArcs\":true,\"engineW\":576,\"engineH\":324,\"engineHalfW\":288,\"engineHalfH\":162,\"engineR\":40.5}PASS: Rounded-rectangle subtle 4-corner SVG markings r=40.5, paths=4PASS: Zone A precision inside boundary (sens=1.0, zero excess, active yaw) {\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":1,\"sensY\":1,\"screenX\":0.609375,\"screenY\":0.5,\"excessX\":0,\"yawVel\":-0.480590111668239}FAIL: Zone B transition slows sensitivity at boundary & clamps reticle strictly to 0.725 {\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.8471499548853431,\"sensY\":1,\"screenX\":0.7125,\"excessX\":0,\"yawVel\":-1.5705930738679506,\"heading1\":18.180953052652416}PASS: Independent axes: Y stays precision 1.0 while X is in transition sensY=1FAIL: Ship does NOT stop turning when reticle is at boundary h1=18.2, h2=18.2, delta=0.0FAIL: Zone C progressive acceleration increases sensitivity & yaw monotonically {\"zoneC1\":{\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.8471499548853431,\"screenX\":0.7125,\"excessX\":0,\"absYaw\":1.5705930738679506},\"zoneC2\":{\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.8471499548853431,\"screenX\":0.7125,\"excessX\":0,\"absYaw\":1.5705930738679506}}FAIL: Reticle NEVER escapes right boundary during deep Zone C overdrive c1=0.7125, c2=0.7125PASS: Pointer Lock warp-spike filter remains active (>500px spike filtered) {\"before\":4,\"after\":5}PASS: Rounded-rectangle corner clamps onto circular arc (not square corner) & preserves X/Y excess {\"clampedX\":272.45230603100634,\"clampedY\":153.4003514672645,\"halfW\":288,\"halfH\":162,\"r\":40.5,\"distFromCornerCenter\":40.49999999999999,\"strictlyInsideBoxCorner\":true,\"onCornerArc\":true,\"excessX\":427.54769396899366,\"excessY\":546.5996485327355}FAIL: Returning inward smoothly restores precision steering (~1.0x) {\"beforeReturn\":\"acceleration\",\"afterReturn\":{\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.6634436376746237,\"excessX\":0,\"screenX\":0.7208314975179007}}FAIL: Boost and forward thrust work properly {\"beforeBoostSpeed\":0.9593361402595497,\"duringBoost\":{\"isBoosting\":true,\"speed\":19.834532397561635,\"boostEnergy\":98.7,\"boostIntensity\":0.36237184837822667}}PASS: Resize to 1024x768 (4:3) updates boundary to 460.8x345.6 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":460.8,\"hudH\":345.6,\"engineW\":460.8,\"engineH\":345.6,\"r\":43.2,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}FAIL: Resize to 1440x600 (21:9) updates boundary to 648x270 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":460.8,\"hudH\":345.6,\"engineW\":460.8,\"engineH\":345.6,\"r\":43.2,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}PASS: Settings panel displays 45% \303\227 45% Aim Boundary Found 45% \303\227 45%PASS: Zero runtime console or page errors {\"consoleErrors\":[],\"pageErrors\":[]}SUMMARY: 11/18 passed"
