rectangle corner clamps onto circular arc (not square corner) & preserves X/Y excess {\"clampedX\":272.45230603100634,\"clampedY\":153.4003514672645,\"halfW\":288,\"halfH\":162,\"r\":40.5,\"distFromCornerCenter\":40.49999999999999,\"strictlyInsideBoxCorner\":true,\"onCornerArc\":true,\"excessX\":427.54769396899366,\"excessY\":546.5996485327355}PASS: Returning inward smoothly restores precision steering (~1.0x) {\"beforeReturn\":{\"zone\":\"acceleration\",\"sensX\":1.3858403358314295,\"rawX\":520},\"afterReturn\":{\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.9998388969741747,\"excessX\":0,\"screenX\":0.5544562303191887,\"rawX\":69.70397480856155}}PASS: Boost and forward thrust work properly {\"beforeBoostSpeed\":1.2326262936627716e-11,\"duringBoost\":{\"isBoosting\":true,\"speed\":182.48896778061138,\"boostEnergy\":79.20000000000005,\"boostIntensity\":0.9992534141916233}}PASS: Resize to 1024x768 (4:3) updates boundary to 460.8x345.6 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":460.8,\"hudH\":345.6,\"engineW\":460.8,\"engineH\":345.6,\"r\":43.2,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}PASS: Resize to 1440x600 (21:9) updates boundary to 648x270 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":648,\"hudH\":270,\"engineW\":648,\"engineH\":270,\"r\":33.75,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}PASS: Zero runtime console or page errors {\"consoleErrors\":[],\"pageErrors\":[]}SUMMARY: 18/18 passed"
