lampedX\":272.45230603100634,\"clampedY\":153.4003514672645,\"halfW\":288,\"halfH\":162,\"r\":40.5,\"distFromCornerCenter\":40.49999999999999,\"strictlyInsideBoxCorner\":true,\"onCornerArc\":true,\"excessX\":427.54769396899366,\"excessY\":546.5996485327355}PASS: Returning inward smoothly restores precision steering (~1.0x) {\"beforeReturn\":\"acceleration\",\"afterReturn\":{\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.9998129340863866,\"excessX\":0,\"screenX\":0.5452201248516151}}FAIL: Resize to 1024x768 (4:3) updates boundary to 409.6x345.6 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":460.8,\"hudH\":345.6,\"engineW\":460.8,\"engineH\":345.6,\"r\":43.2,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}FAIL: Resize to 1440x600 (21:9) updates boundary to 576x270 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":648,\"hudH\":270,\"engineW\":648,\"engineH\":270,\"r\":33.75,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}PASS: Zero runtime console or page errors {\"consoleErrors\":[],\"pageErrors\":[]}SUMMARY: 10/16 passed"
