      content: "Task id \"49f9382e-a5a8-4ac9-ad38-8127f285cebb/task-85\" finished with result:\nCommand output:\nFAIL: Settings panel displays 40% \303\227 45% Aim Boundary (defaults) Defaults verified in Settings UIPASS: Pointer Lock engaged natively on WebGL canvas {\"nativePointerLockElementTag\":\"CANVAS\",\"lockOwned\":true}FAIL: 1280x720 aim boundary width = 40% (512px, half 256px) {\"shape\":\"rounded-rect\",\"hudW\":576,\"hudH\":324,\"hudR\":40.5,\"pathCount\":4,\"allHaveArcs\":true,\"engineW\":576,\"engineH\":324,\"engineHalfW\":288,\"engineHalfH\":162,\"engineR\":40.5}PASS: 1280x720 aim boundary height = 45% (324px, half 162px) {\"shape\":\"rounded-rect\",\"hudW\":576,\"hudH\":324,\"hudR\":40.5,\"pathCount\":4,\"allHaveArcs\":true,\"engineW\":576,\"engineH\":324,\"engineHalfW\":288,\"engineHalfH\":162,\"engineR\":40.5}PASS: Rounded-rectangle subtle 4-corner SVG markings r=40.5, paths=4PASS: Zone A precision inside boundary (sens=1.0, zero excess, active yaw) {\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":1,\"sensY\":1,\"screenX\":0.609375,\"excessX\":0,\"rawX\":140,\"yawVel\":-0.8814683118716419}FAIL: Zone B transition slows sensitivity at boundary & clamps reticle strictly to 0.700 {\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.44214772862625507,\"sensY\":1,\"screenX\":0.7171875,\"excessX\":0,\"rawX\":278,\"yawVel\":-0.8960823877682595,\"heading1\":100.48387048438208}PASS: Independent axes: Y stays precision 1.0 while X is in transition sensY=1PASS: Ship does NOT stop turning when reticle is held at boundary h1=100.5, h2=115.0, delta=14.5 degPASS: Zone C progressive acceleration increases sensitivity & yaw monotonically {\"zoneC1\":{\"zone\":\"acceleration\",\"sensX\":1.3774477560006866,\"screenX\":0.725,\"excessX\":230,\"absYaw\":2.8896602951556236},\"zoneC2\":{\"zone\":\"acceleration\",\"sensX\":2.2793961128239206,\"screenX\":0.725,\"excessX\":710,\"absYaw\":4.786517637230001}}FAIL: Reticle NEVER escapes right boundary (0.700) during deep Zone C overdrive c1=0.725, c2=0.725PASS: Rounded-rectangle corner clamps onto circular arc (not square corner) & preserves X/Y excess {\"clampedX\":272.45230603100634,\"clampedY\":153.4003514672645,\"halfW\":288,\"halfH\":162,\"r\":40.5,\"distFromCornerCenter\":40.49999999999999,\"strictlyInsideBoxCorner\":true,\"onCornerArc\":true,\"excessX\":427.54769396899366,\"excessY\":546.5996485327355}PASS: Returning inward smoothly restores precision steering (~1.0x) {\"beforeReturn\":\"acceleration\",\"afterReturn\":{\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.9998129340863866,\"excessX\":0,\"screenX\":0.5452201248516151}}FAIL: Resize to 1024x768 (4:3) updates boundary to 409.6x345.6 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":460.8,\"hudH\":345.6,\"engineW\":460.8,\"engineH\":345.6,\"r\":43.2,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}FAIL: Resize to 1440x600 (21:9) updates boundary to 576x270 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":648,\"hudH\":270,\"engineW\":648,\"engineH\":270,\"r\":33.75,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}PASS: Zero runtime console or page errors {\"consoleErrors\":[],\"pageErrors\":[]}SUMMARY: 10/16 passed"
