7768` (`409.6 \303\227 345.6 px`, `r = 43.2 px`) and `1440\303\227600` (`576 \303\227 270 px`, `r = 33.75 px`).\n\n### 5. Remaining Issues\n- None identified from compilation, type-checking, or automated Chromium testing."
