849129155997}}PASS: Reticle NEVER escapes right boundary (0.700) during deep Zone C overdrive c1=0.7, c2=0.7PASS: Rounded-rectangle corner clamps onto circular arc (not square corner) & preserves X/Y excess {\"clampedX\":241.50393787390698,\"clampedY\":152.54907752333372,\"halfW\":256,\"halfH\":162,\"r\":40.5,\"distFromCornerCenter\":40.500000000000014,\"strictlyInsideBoxCorner\":true,\"onCornerArc\":true,\"excessX\":458.496062126093,\"excessY\":547.4509224766663}PASS: Returning inward smoothly restores precision steering (~1.0x) {\"beforeReturn\":\"acceleration\",\"afterReturn\":{\"zone\":\"precision\",\"sensX\":0.9999064777747927,\"excessX\":0,\"screenX\":0.5349526337399372}}PASS: Resize to 1024x768 (4:3) updates boundary to 409.6x345.6 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":409.6,\"hudH\":345.6,\"engineW\":409.6,\"engineH\":345.6,\"r\":43.2,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}PASS: Resize to 1440x600 (21:9) updates boundary to 576x270 & keeps reticle clamped {\"hudW\":576,\"hudH\":270,\"engineW\":576,\"engineH\":270,\"r\":33.75,\"insideRoundedRect\":true}PASS: Zero runtime console or page errors {\"consoleErrors\":[],\"pageErrors\":[]}SUMMARY: 16/16 passed"
